<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says to appoint new chairman on Wed.</title>
<headline>Volvo says to appoint new chairman on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group AB Volvo said on Tuesday it would appoint a new chairman on Wednesday to replace Bert-Olof Svanholm who died on Tuesday .</p>
<p>&quot;The board will have a meeting tomorrow and then a new chairman will be appointed,&quot; Volvo spokesman Mats Edenborg told Reuters.</p>
<p>Volvo announced earlier in the day that Svanholm, 62, had died after being ill for some time.</p>
<p>-- Olle Lindstrom, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
